WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.515
Roxy looked outside.

2
00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:20.962
The Electric Elves ran to their motorcycles.

3
00:00:20.963 --> 00:00:24.930
Zap! Electricity shot from the elf leader's hand.

4
00:00:24.931 --> 00:00:27.261
All the motorcycles started up.

5
00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:30.944
Rumble! Rumble!

6
00:00:30.945 --> 00:00:38.724
The Electric Elves hopped onto the motorcycles and rode away.

7
00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:42.353
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

8
00:00:42.354 --> 00:00:45.506
"The elves' clubhouse is really far from here.

9
00:00:45.507 --> 00:00:47.684
And I can't fly!"

10
00:00:47.685 --> 00:00:52.957
Roxy sighed. "I've lost my super powers.

11
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:55.386
But I'm still Rocket Girl.

12
00:00:55.387 --> 00:01:00.386
And Rocket Girl can still stop those elves!"

13
00:01:00.387 --> 00:01:03.487
Roxy went outside and stomped down the street.

14
00:01:03.488 --> 00:01:05.995
A few people stared at her.

15
00:01:05.996 --> 00:01:09.296
"That's strange," said a man with a dog.

16
00:01:09.297 --> 00:01:16.998
"Rocket Girl is taking a walk!"

17
00:01:16.999 --> 00:01:21.633
"Why aren't you flying, Rocket Girl?" asked a little girl.

18
00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:27.217
Roxy sighed and kept walking.

19
00:01:27.218 --> 00:01:30.449
Finally she got to the Electric Elves' clubhouse.

20
00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.446
She was tired and she was mad!

21
00:01:33.447 --> 00:01:37.052
The elves' motorcycles were parked in front of the clubhouse.

22
00:01:37.053 --> 00:01:40.214
Electricity buzzed all around them.

23
00:01:40.215 --> 00:01:43.170
Roxy kicked a motorcycle hard.

24
00:01:43.171 --> 00:01:45.379
Zap! Zap!

25
00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:48.484
"Whoa!" Roxy felt another shock.

26
00:01:48.485 --> 00:01:51.128
Electricity buzzed through her again.

27
00:01:51.129 --> 00:01:54.659
And then suddenly . . .

28
00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:58.543
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams fired!

29
00:01:58.544 --> 00:02:02.982
The elves' motorcycles exploded into little pieces.

30
00:02:02.983 --> 00:02:08.569
"Yes!" Roxy cheered. "Rocket Girl is back!"

31
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:13.125
Roxy used her X-ray vision and looked into the clubhouse.

32
00:02:13.126 --> 00:02:18.478
The elves were sitting at a table and playing cards.

33
00:02:18.479 --> 00:02:22.617
Roxy listened with her super hearing.

34
00:02:22.618 --> 00:02:25.709
"Ha-ha!" The elf leader laughed.

35
00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:30.424
"Rocket Girl is the worst superhero in the world!"

36
00:02:30.425 --> 00:02:32.936
"Yeah!" said another elf.

37
00:02:32.937 --> 00:02:35.805
"We took away her super powers!"

38
00:02:35.806 --> 00:02:40.392
"You mean I took away her super powers!" said the elf leader.

39
00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.963
"Of course, boss," said the elf.

40
00:02:42.964 --> 00:02:46.012
"You took away her super powers."

41
00:02:46.013 --> 00:02:49.691
"Let's rob some banks tomorrow!" said a third elf.

42
00:02:49.692 --> 00:02:55.322
All the elves laughed.

43
00:02:55.323 --> 00:02:58.707
"Those elves are going to be sorry!" thought Roxy.

44
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:06.002
She blasted off into the air.

45
00:03:06.003 --> 00:03:11.128
Terrell was looking through the telescope.

46
00:03:11.129 --> 00:03:16.775
He gasped. "Rocket Girl!"

47
00:03:16.776 --> 00:03:23.495
Zoom! Roxy shot back down to earth and smashed into the clubhouse.

48
00:03:23.496 --> 00:03:31.826
Ka-boom! Pieces went everywhere.

49
00:03:31.827 --> 00:03:35.604
"Our clubhouse!" cried the elf leader.

50
00:03:35.605 --> 00:03:37.898
He held up his hand.

51
00:03:37.899 --> 00:03:41.666
Zap! Electricity shot toward Roxy.

52
00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:43.887
Roxy blocked the electricity.

53
00:03:43.888 --> 00:03:48.150
Zap-pow! The sparks flew back at the elf leader.

54
00:03:48.151 --> 00:03:53.143
Electricity buzzed through him, and he fell to the floor.

55
00:03:53.144 --> 00:04:01.179
Roxy smiled. "You elves are going to jail."

56
00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:04.884
"I'm back!" said Roxy, walking into Jack's backyard.

57
00:04:04.885 --> 00:04:07.823
Terrell was still looking through the telescope.

58
00:04:07.824 --> 00:04:12.004
"Terrell thinks he saw Rocket Girl in space," said Mara.

59
00:04:12.005 --> 00:04:15.862
Terrell frowned. "I did!"

60
00:04:15.863 --> 00:04:18.418
"I believe you," said Roxy.

61
00:04:18.419 --> 00:04:28.523
"Can I have a turn with the telescope now?"

62
00:04:28.524 --> 00:04:39.154
[caption_out@
